<item><title>Sudan security agents hold three Blue Nile volunteers without family or lawyer access</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-security-agents-hold-three-blue-nile-volunteers-68816e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-security-agents-hold-three-blue-nile-volunteers-68816e/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The General Intelligence Service arrested the community group members on November 23 over allegations of receiving funds from an activist in Uganda.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:49:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sudan rejects Ethiopia&apos;s offer to host peace talks</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-rejects-ethiopia-s-offer-to-host-peace-talks-9086b9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-rejects-ethiopia-s-offer-to-host-peace-talks-9086b9/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>Khartoum says Ethiopia lacks neutrality, accusing it of backing the Rapid Support Forces and allowing attacks on Sudan from its territory.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:29:40 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sudan loses OPCW council seat as pressure mounts over weapons allegations</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-loses-opcw-council-seat-as-pressure-mounts-over-89f778/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-loses-opcw-council-seat-as-pressure-mounts-over-89f778/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The OPCW chief urged countries with evidence to share it and called for Sudan to circulate findings from its national investigation.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:26:34 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Drone attacks kill civilians in Sudan’s Blue Nile cities</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/drone-attacks-kill-civilians-in-sudan-s-blue-nile-cities-199ab5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/drone-attacks-kill-civilians-in-sudan-s-blue-nile-cities-199ab5/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The resistance committees say strikes hit homes in Damazin and Roseires on Tuesday, killing about 14 civilians and injuring 15.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:28:20 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/drone-attacks-kill-civilians-in-sudan-s-blue-nile-cities-199ab5/share.jpg" length="41109" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/drone-attacks-kill-civilians-in-sudan-s-blue-nile-cities-199ab5/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
